script = ExtResource("1_ja061")
name = "The Enlightened One's Teachings"
pages = Array[String](["[center]The autumn air grows cold.
The tree of Enlightenment has shed its leaves.
This Scribe gathers them, so the way is not lost.

From the brush of the second Scribe of the Enlightened One
From the brush of the third Scribe of the Enlightened One
From the brush of the fourth Scribe of the Enlightened One




[i]Translator's note: many pages are missing, and the order of the existing pages is uncertain.[/i]
[/center]", "By the winding river, the tiller wept. He said:
\"The Emperor decreed that fields must bear only golden stalks, but my stalks are silver.\"

The Enlightened One said:
\"The pine forest is devoured by the pine beetle. To force the ten thousand things into one is to destroy them. Leave the gold to the lord of gold. Take your silver to the high place. When the field of gold burns, the people see the worth of silver.\"", "A great king came to the Enlightened One. He said:
\"My ministers seek to undermine my rule.\"

The Enlightened One said:
\"The state is like a bowl. Discontent is like the crack. The fine bowl holds water even if cracked. The badly made bowl will shatter.\"

When the king left, the Enlightened One said to us:
\"Ours is the badly made bowl. When the bowl shatters, you will be left to put the shards back together.\"", "The foremost of the Enlightened One's followers asked:
\"How will we know wisdom?\"

The Enlightened One said:
\"When the child sees her parent bring fruit from the market, she calls the market the source of fruit. When the adult hears wisdom from the teacher, she calls the teacher the source of wisdom. When the elder sees the cicada leave its shell, she is enlightened.\"", "In the winter, a novice complained to the Enlightened One:
\"The mountains are cold and the people below have hearths.\"

The Enlightened One said:
\"The fire burns wood and gives heat. The spirit gives heat and burns no wood. When there is no wood, the fire goes out.\"", "An elder came to the Enlightened One and said:
\"What is left when my body is gone?\"

The Enlightened One said:
\"When the empire makes war, the wasteland is left. When the farmer plants rice, the field is left.\"", "At the deathbed of the Enlightened One, the Scribe asked:
\"Who will lead us after you are gone?\"

The Enlightened One said:
\"When the lightning strikes the persimmon tree, it burns down. When the ground heals, from the roots the sapling sprouts. When the sapling matures, it bears the same persimmons.\""])
icon = ExtResource("1_ndd7m")
